Cut against the official vllm/vllm-openai:inkling-2-mini image (7cb5dae22).
On Ada, use ordered CUDA launches, portable conv/mix and FlashAttention 2
for the image encoder. The shipped MoE alignment binary lacks the SM89
kernel used by Humming, so group token slots with PyTorch on this GPU.

SM89 bring-up reference: https://www.reddit.com/r/LocalLLaMA/comments/1y1n4k7/

